p9share NEWS -- history of user-visible changes

* 0.1.0
  First package.  p9share export / unexport (as a user), mount / unmount (root), rw / ro / off (as the user), status, wsl-boot; the p9share
  service (p9share boot) starts at boot, keeps each tunnel up and each mount right.  Replaces the prototype scripts (p9share, p9mode,
  p9share-mountd): see INSTALL for moving over.
